title: "Sample-adaptive volumetric quantification of the central cylinder in Salicornia europaea stems"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for sample-adaptive radial boundary detection and random forest
  tissue classification applied to X-ray microCT volumes of Salicornia europaea
  stems.
